\fs36 \cf2 1. Problem Statement & Opportunity\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Solo coaches, sports academies, and boutique workshop hosts run their customer acquisition and scheduling manually over WhatsApp and Instagram direct messages. The standard workflow today suffers from four critical points of friction:\
\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Unstructured Scheduling:
\f1\b0  Every prospective lead triggers a manual chat negotiation over available days and timings.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Detached Payments:
\f1\b0  Merchants paste personal UPI IDs or standalone payment links without binding payment to an actual inventory slot, risking double-booking or slot-holding dropouts.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Manual Reconciliation:
\f1\b0  Coaches maintain offline paper registers or notes apps to track payments, attendance, and cancellations.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Trust Deficit:
\f1\b0  First-time students hesitate to transfer upfront funds to unverified personal UPI IDs without clear cancellation terms.\uc0\u8232 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Spotlight Solution:
\f1\b0  An in-app, mobile-first utility that allows a merchant to voice-dictate their offering in under 45 seconds. The platform parses the speech into a structured scheduling package, publishes a high-converting, hosted booking page with Razorpay trust signals, locks slot inventory upon UPI payment, and populates an automated merchant operating roster.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

